    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22904" root="شل" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَلُولٌ</span></b> , of she-camels, and of women, (O, K, in
the latter of which, in the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَالنِّسَآءِ</span>, is found
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">والشَّآءِ</span> [i. e. and of sheep or. goats], TA,) is like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَابٌ</span> [meaning <i>Aged</i>]. (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُلْشُلٌ</span>,
in two places.

